Cont [SimTalk] - pe, Store
Returns the MU, which is located at the top-most position on the designated storage place (production
element) of the Store designated by <Path>.
Type
Read-only attribute
Syntax
<Path>.pe(X:integer, Y:integer).Cont → object
<Path>[X:integer, Y:integer].Cont → object
Parameters
You can specify the following parameters:
• The parameter X of data type integer designates the position of the storage place (on the production
element) in the X-Dimension.
• The parameter Y of data type integer designates the position of the storage place (on the production
element) in the Y-Dimension.
Return Value
The return value has the data type object.
Example
MyStore.pe(1,1).Cont.move(Station)
MyStore[1,1].Cont.move(Station)
See also
